# QA M4 (acceptance bug, fixed in the level): Resi standing still on the
# stone bench at the Markt entrance (col 152) next to Selfie-Tourist #3's pen.
# The bug: the tourist's hitbox is 20 px tall and the bench was 1 tile (16
# px), so his head poked 4 px above the bench top when he turned at it; with
# her hitbox even 0.2 px past the bench's right edge his head touched her
# feet while she stood (vy 0): a hurt, as Normal death (was: Died at 1971).
# Fix (D-066 addendum, "Pen walls"): every wall a walker turns at and Resi
# can stand on is >= 2 tiles above the walker's floor; the bench is now 2
# high (rows 13-14), so his head stays 12 px below her feet.
# Steps: st_wolfgang_solver inputs to 1160 (on the road before the
# checkpoint), walk to the bench, jump onto it, step right until her hitbox
# overhangs the bench's right edge by 6 px (x 2442, right edge 2454; the
# tourist turns with his left edge at 2448), wait while he comes back and
# turns under her (twice in the wait).
level  = st_wolfgang
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = deaths=0 no_event=Hurt no_event=Died state=playing
expect = player_x>=2441 player_y>=186 player_y<=186
